#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_wires.rst:4
msgid "Export wires"
msgstr "导出电线"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_wires.rst:6
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows creating a CSV file which contains a list of all "
"`conductors`_ / wires from the `project`_. The CSV file can be opened and "
"edited with tools as `LibreOffice Calc`_."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 允许创建 CSV 文件，其中包含一个来自 `导体 <conductors_>`_ 的全部 `项目 <project_>`_ /"
" 线条的列表。CSV 文件可以使用工具打开和编辑为 `LibreOffice Calc <LibreOffice Calc_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_wires.rst:9
msgid ""
"The different field properties are listed by columns and the `conductors`_ /"
" wires are ordered by `folio`_."
msgstr "不同字段属性按列列出，`导体 <conductors_>`_/线由 `图幅 <folio_>`_ 订购。"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_wires.rst:11
msgid "To export the `conductors`_ / wires list to CSV file:"
msgstr "要将 `导体 <conductors_>`_ / 电线列表导出到 CSV 文件："

#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_wires.rst:13
msgid ""
"Select **Project > Export the list of names of wires** menu item to open the"
" exporting PopUp window."
msgstr "选择 **项目 > 导出线条名称列表** 菜单项打开导出弹出窗口 。"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_wires.rst:14
msgid "Choose target directory and file name."
msgstr "选择目标目录和文件名称 。"

#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_wires.rst:15
msgid "Press **Save** button to create the file with extension ``.csv``."
msgstr "按 **保存** 按钮创建带有扩展名的文件 ``.csv``."

#: ../../source/users/export&print/export_wires.rst:20
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech project menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 项目菜单"
